# ==============================================================================
# Vault Project - Git Attributes Configuration
# ==============================================================================
# Enterprise-grade Git attributes for Vault:
# - Cross-platform line ending normalization (strict LF standard, CRLF for Windows batch)
# - Specialized Git diff drivers for syntax-aware diffs (TypeScript, HTML, CSS, Markdown, etc.)
# - Safe merge handling for package lockfiles (merge=binary prevents corruption)
# - Comprehensive binary definitions preventing whitespace corruption & line-ending shifts
# - GitHub Linguist categorization (language stats, docs, vendored shims, generated bundles)
# - Suppressed diffs (-diff) on heavy generated reports, logs, code-memory, & minified assets
# - Git Archive release optimization (export-ignore for CI, dev env, tests, and temporary artifacts)
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. GLOBAL DEFAULTS & LINE ENDING NORMALIZATION
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Auto-detect all files as text and normalize line endings to LF on commit.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Explicit binary fallback (disable line ending changes or text diff heuristics)
*.bin                       binary

# Strict preservation of verbatim line endings for patch and diff artifacts
*.patch                     -text
*.diff                      -text

